/				4	ENTRY
/				5	GLOBAL REGULAR SYMBOL
/				6	EXTERNAL
/				7	EXTERNAL PAGE 0 (ZTERN)
/
/	NOTE:	BIT 9 ON MEANS BELONGS TO LSD
